WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.952 --> 00:00:21.020
"I'm hungry," the pig complained, patting his belly.

2
00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:25.722
"It's a talking pig," Roxy whispered to Detective Smith.

3
00:00:25.742 --> 00:00:29.164
"He's holding a rake," Detective Smith said.

4
00:00:30.464 --> 00:00:35.746
The bakery's owner raced outside, yelling, "You destroyed my bakery!"

5
00:00:35.766 --> 00:00:39.088
"Bah!" The pig walked away.

6
00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:44.990
right there!"

7
00:00:45.330 --> 00:00:46.030
Roxy ordered.

8
00:00:47.151 --> 00:00:47.991
The pig snorted.

9
00:00:48.011 --> 00:00:51.913
"No!" Whiz-hoo!

10
00:00:52.293 --> 00:00:55.334
Roxy fired her eye laser beams, striking the pig in the face.

11
00:00:55.354 --> 00:00:58.035
"Ouch! How did you do that?"

12
00:00:58.395 --> 00:00:59.616
he asked, rubbing his face.

13
00:01:00.940 --> 00:01:02.221
"I have super powers!"

14
00:01:03.122 --> 00:01:06.244
Roxy flew into him, and they tumbled across the sidewalk.

15
00:01:07.325 --> 00:01:08.486
People leaped out of the way.

16
00:01:09.527 --> 00:01:12.129
The pig jumped to his feet and swung his rake.

17
00:01:12.149 --> 00:01:13.690
"Who are you?"

18
00:01:13.710 --> 00:01:19.115
"Every villain knows who I am," Roxy said, dodging the rake.

19
00:01:19.715 --> 00:01:22.658
Whiz-hoo! She shot her eye laser beams again.

20
00:01:23.718 --> 00:01:25.640
The pig blocked the laser beams with his rake.

21
00:01:25.660 --> 00:01:33.276
"But I'm not a villain—I'm Zhu Bajie."

22
00:01:33.296 --> 00:01:37.258
"Well, I'm Rocket Girl—a powerful superhero!"

23
00:01:37.558 --> 00:01:39.378
Roxy said, charging toward Bajie.

24
00:01:40.318 --> 00:01:41.859
Bajie puffed out his chest.

25
00:01:41.879 --> 00:01:44.039
"I'm a powerful spirit!"

26
00:01:44.840 --> 00:01:49.421
He held up his rake, ready to strike, but Roxy slammed into him—pow!

27
00:01:50.401 --> 00:01:51.741
Bajie flew backward.

28
00:01:53.442 --> 00:01:54.502
"Watch out!"

29
00:01:54.962 --> 00:01:57.283
A woman on a bike swerved.

30
00:01:58.983 --> 00:02:01.264
Crack! Bajie hit a fire hydrant.

31
00:02:02.228 --> 00:02:11.370
Water sprayed, and a taxi slid into a flower As Roxy checked on the taxi driver, Bajie rubbed

32
00:02:11.410 --> 00:02:11.771
his head.

33
00:02:11.791 --> 00:02:14.751
"I'd better escape," he thought.

34
00:02:14.771 --> 00:02:17.972
"This person is powerful, like a goddess."

35
00:02:19.293 --> 00:02:20.613
Bajie recited a spell.

36
00:02:23.874 --> 00:02:27.835
As he leaped onto a cloud, a delicious aroma drifted through the air toward him.

37
00:02:30.095 --> 00:02:31.836
"What wonderful food is that?"

38
00:02:32.320 --> 00:02:32.840
he murmured.

39
00:02:33.941 --> 00:02:35.301
Bajie followed the smell.

40
00:02:35.321 --> 00:02:37.782
It was coming from a building in the distance.

41
00:02:37.802 --> 00:02:41.764
"Where did Zhu Bajie go?"

42
00:02:42.164 --> 00:02:43.805
Roxy murmured, looking around.

43
00:02:43.825 --> 00:02:50.227
"The pig flew away on a cloud," Detective Smith said, hurrying over.

44
00:02:51.388 --> 00:02:52.789
Roxy's eyes went wide.

45
00:02:52.809 --> 00:02:54.129
"He can fly?

46
00:02:54.449 --> 00:02:55.470
Which way did he go?"

47
00:02:55.490 --> 00:03:00.852
"That way," Detective Smith said, pointing toward Metro City Elementary School.

48
00:03:01.744 --> 00:03:05.066
Roxy flew fast and spotted Bajie landing near the school's entrance.

49
00:03:06.567 --> 00:03:07.707
She landed in front of him.

50
00:03:09.668 --> 00:03:12.410
Bajie waved his rake back and forth.

51
00:03:13.230 --> 00:03:14.131
"Leave me alone!"

52
00:03:15.952 --> 00:03:16.952
Roxy grabbed the rake.

53
00:03:18.373 --> 00:03:19.734
"Look!" Mara said.

54
00:03:19.754 --> 00:03:23.496
"It's Rocket Girl—she's fighting a pig!"

55
00:03:24.697 --> 00:03:26.217
Roxy's friends ran to the window.

56
00:03:26.237 --> 00:03:28.699
"Let go of my rake!"

57
00:03:29.199 --> 00:03:30.019
Bajie shouted.

58
00:03:31.288 --> 00:03:34.049
"No!" Roxy yanked the rake from his hand.

59
00:03:35.169 --> 00:03:38.650
"Go, Rocket Girl," Terrell cried, pumping his fist.

60
00:03:40.310 --> 00:03:44.612
Bajie stomped toward Roxy, but abruptly he stopped to bend over and take a breath.

61
00:03:51.453 --> 00:03:52.614
Roxy scratched her head.

62
00:03:53.374 --> 00:03:55.074
"Er What are you doing?"

63
00:03:55.094 --> 00:03:58.615
"Resting," Bajie answered.

64
00:03:59.616 --> 00:04:00.916
Roxy's mouth dropped open.

65
00:04:01.428 --> 00:04:04.630
"What?" "I'm tired!"

66
00:04:04.950 --> 00:04:09.072
Bajie yelled, "and I—burp!—I ate too much."

67
00:04:11.814 --> 00:04:14.455
"You're under arrest, Bajie," Roxy said.

68
00:04:17.277 --> 00:04:20.779
Suddenly Bajie pulled a sign out of the ground and flung it at Roxy.

69
00:04:21.679 --> 00:04:23.800
She ducked, and the sign hit a passing truck.

70
00:04:25.101 --> 00:04:27.262
"Ahh!" The driver crashed into a bush.

71
00:04:28.183 --> 00:04:29.944
Roxy hurried away to check on the driver.

72
00:04:32.332 --> 00:04:34.534
When she returned, Bajie had disappeared.

73
00:04:36.035 --> 00:04:38.217
Using her super hearing, she heard snoring.

74
00:04:43.982 --> 00:04:46.264
She followed the sound to the school's equipment shed.

75
00:04:46.884 --> 00:04:51.408
She threw the door open and saw Bajie inside, sleeping on a gym mat.

76
00:04:55.952 --> 00:05:00.236
Slowly and quietly, Roxy lifted Bajie up and carried him off to jail.
